----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of the licence above and bundled third-party assets
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence covers the code written for this project: the Python packages
under src/ (common, linkage, messageix, and the Python interface in
src/sturm/*.py), the tests, the viz/ scripts, the notebooks, data/inputs.xlsx and the documentation.

The following third-party assets are NOT covered by the MIT licence above and
keep their own terms:

- The STURM R model and its input data (src/sturm/model/, src/sturm/data/,
  src/sturm/run_sturm_headless.R): a fork of IIASA's message-ix-buildings
  (Apache License 2.0 — see src/sturm/LICENSE-APACHE; fork edits are logged in
  docs/data/sturm_fork_changelog.md).
- The MESSAGEix-Austria baseline workbook (data/MESSAGEix-AT_baseline_4.xlsx),
  derived from the IIASA/WU guideline handover.
- The Macko (2025) dataset (data/macko_reduction.xlsx).

Redistribution permission for the last two has not yet been confirmed by their
originators; they are therefore NOT included in this repository and are
available on request. The Austrian
reference data under data/ is derived from Statistik Austria (STATcube) and is
attributed in data/README.md and data/austria_raw/SOURCES.md.
